Package: MetaPj
Type: Package
Title: Meta-Analysis with the Pj Python Service
Version: 1.1.0
Author: Maurizio Agosti
Maintainer: Maurizio Agosti <magosti@gmail.com>
Description: Demonstrates a jamovi module combining native controls, metafor
    calculations and Python presentation through a separately installed Pj module.
    Includes dichotomous, independent-group mean difference and generic
    effect-size inputs with sampling variances, standard errors or confidence intervals.
